  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 1602.11 “Rate schedule” means the initial collection of information along with any revisions filed by a utility which includes the most recent rate schedule cover sheet and all effective rate sheets.\n\nSource. #14030, eff 7-25-24 (formerly Puc 1602.05)",
